{"suttaId":"sn25.9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[1156,1156],"vripara":"310"},"segments":{"sn25.9:0.3":"Pathavīdhātusuttaṃ","sn25.9:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn25.9:1.2":"“Pathavīdhātu, bhikkhave, aniccā vipariṇāmī aññathābhāvī;","sn25.9:1.3":"āpodhātu…","sn25.9:1.4":"tejodhātu…","sn25.9:1.5":"vāyodhātu…","sn25.9:1.6":"ākāsadhātu…","sn25.9:1.7":"viññāṇadhātu aniccā vipariṇāmī aññathābhāvī.","sn25.9:1.8":"Yo, bhikkhave, ime dhamme evaṃ saddahati adhimuccati, ayaṃ vuccati ‘saddhānusārī…pe…","sn25.9:1.9":"sambodhiparāyano’”ti.","sn25.9:1.10":"Navamaṃ. 10."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":449,"to":451,"paras":[{"para":449,"vripara":"302-311","refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Okkantasaṃyutte <b>adhimuccatī</b>ti saddhādhimokkhaṃ paṭilabhati.","<b>Okkanto sammattaniyāma</b>nti paviṭṭho ariyamaggaṃ.","<b>Abhabbo ca tāva kālaṃ kātu</b>nti iminā uppanne magge phalassa anantarāyataṃ dīpeti.","Uppannasmiñhi magge phalassa antarāyakaraṇaṃ nāma natthi.","Tenevāha –","“ayañca puggalo sotāpattiphalasacchikiriyāya paṭipanno assa, kappassa ca uḍḍayhanavelā assa, neva tāva kappo uḍḍayheyya, yāvāyaṃ puggalo na sotāpattiphalaṃ sacchikaroti, ayaṃ vuccati puggalo ṭhitakappī”ti (pu. pa. 17).","<b>Mattaso nijjhānaṃ khamantī</b>ti pamāṇato olokanaṃ khamanti.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"]]},{"para":450,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Okkantasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 5."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"]]},{"para":451,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Uppādasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā 312-321."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":472,"to":475,"paras":[{"para":472,"vripara":"302-311","refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["<b>Saddhādhimokkha</b>nti saddahanavasena pavattaṃ adhimokkhaṃ, na sanniṭṭhānamattavasena pavattaṃ adhimokkhaṃ.","Dassanampi sammattaṃ, taṃsijjhānavasena pavattaniyāmo <b>sammattaniyāmo,</b> ariyamaggo.","<b>Anantarāyataṃ dīpeti</b> kappavināsapaṭibhāgena pavattattā.","Tathā cāha <b>“tenevāhā”</b>tiādi.","Kappasīsena bhājanalokaṃ vadati.","So hi uḍḍayhati, na kappo, <b>uḍḍayhanavelā</b>ti jhāyanavelā.","Ṭhito kappo ṭhitakappo, so assa atthīti <b>ṭhitakappī,</b> kappaṃ ṭhapetuṃ samatthoti attho.","<b>Olokana</b>nti saccābhisamayasaṅkhātaṃ dassanaṃ.","<b>Khamanti</b> sahanti, ñāyantīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"],["sn25.9:1"]]},{"para":473,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Cakkhusuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"]]},{"para":474,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Okkantasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 5."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"]]},{"para":475,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.9:1"],"lines":["Uppādasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā 312-321."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.9:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
